## 12. NOVELTY — WHAT MAKES THIS DIFFERENT

1. **3-Layer Consensus Engine** — No existing open-source IDS uses a vote-based consensus of supervised ML + unsupervised ML + threat intelligence.

2. **AI Copilot Integration** — First open-source IDS with LLM-powered alert explanation, MITRE ATT&CK mapping, and playbook generation.

3. **Full-Stack Production System** — Not a Jupyter notebook. A deployable web application with dashboard, user management, alerting, reporting.

4. **Transparent Decision Making** — Every alert shows exactly which layers voted and why. No black-box scores.

5. **IPv6-Aware Consensus** — Automatically adjusts voting when TI APIs lack IPv6 coverage.

6. **One-Command Deployment** — `bash start_demo.sh` brings up the entire stack.

